lines.text:
Huh?
Oh, {G}
What happened?

lines.original:
{P}
体育で、ちょっと怪我を
してしまいまして。

lines.text:
{P}
I hurt myself a little
in gym class.

Okay, {G}
try not to
space out so much.

Getting hurt while
spacing out... that's
so very {G}

Um, {G}
is it really okay
for me to keep this?

Ahh, bliss.
Warm like {G}
and her sweet heart.

Sh-she's fast.
(Who knew {G}
could run so fast...)

Where did {G}
go off to...?
Oh, there she is.

Ah, {G}
you were at the
carnivorous plants.

Okay, {G}
is waiting for me.
I'd better hurry up.

Everyone else ran,
so why is {G}
the only one soaked?

Whoever {G}
knits something for
is a lucky person.

Y-{G}
if it's your first time,
practice down here...

A-are you okay?
Oh, {G}
Here, grab my hand.

Well?
So, {G}
can you get down?
